| --- | --- | --- |
| [{{ name }}](#overview) | `load {{ name }}` | the [`pool`](#pools) and [`locks`](#locks) parts |
| [pool](#pool-decorator) | `load {{ name }}/pool` | the [`@pool`](#pool-decorator) decorator |
| [locks](#locks) | `load {{ name }}/locks` | the [locks](#locks): [`amk.mutex`](#locks), [`amk.horcrux`](#locks), [`amk.rendezvous`](#locks) |
| [job](job.md) | `load {{ name }}/job` | [`amk.job`](job.md): the host's job verbs under one name, with a job table, a wait on a set, and mail from make |
